312
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:09,000
Her yekî li xerbatî ye.
 
Everyone is in exile.

313
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:12,000
Ya rebbî silavê min ji giya ra heye qurban.
 
Oh Lord, my greetings are to everyone, my dear.

314
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:15,000
Wekî gotî, ji giya ra jî elhemdulillah zehkirî ye.
 
As said, praise be to God, everyone is mentioned.

315
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,000
Saeta we xweş.
 
Have a good time.

316
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:18,000
Bimînin di xêr û xweşiyê de.
 
Stay in goodness and happiness.

317
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:20,000
Di saeta we xweş.
 
Have a good time.

318
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:23,000
Bi marûbin nuka, leqtek nuka jî emê çêkin ji gundî me mala.
 
Stay with us now, we will make a shot now of the village
