Yes.

324
00:36:36,000 --> 00:36:38,000
Bes gundî me mala bi şiklê am.
 
But the houses of our village in general form.

325
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:40,000
Pir mewqeyê xwe xweş e, xêra.
 
Its location is very nice, for the sake of [this].

326
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:42,000
Gelo hember me Reco ye.
 
Look, opposite us is Rajo.

327
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:50,000
