329
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:58,000
Hemberî çokî bilind e dere.
 
Opposite is a very high bank/cliff there.

330
00:36:58,000 --> 00:37:00,000
Û yolî tirkî jî meb xuyê.
 
And the Turkish side also appears.

331
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:03,000
Mewqeyekî pir xweş e, gelo maşallah, gelo çi pal e?
 
It is a very nice location, look Mashallah, look what a
