332
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:06,000
Were.
 
Come.

333
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:09,000
Çika were qîza gundî, were vir seke.
 
Just come, girl of the village, come here look.

334
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:12,000
Erê, ev Zîkrayat e gundî ye.
 
Yes, this is Zikrayat of the village.

335
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:15,000
Zîkrayat, wekî çi dil veda ye ne?
 
Zikrayat, like what [is recorded] in the heart, right?

336
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:20,000
Dê sêr kin, qîza xaltîkê, lê sêr kin, revî, di hewşê wa
