337
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:23,000
Erê, bêdengî, hewş e, taq tenê ye xweş.
 
Yes, silence, it is a courtyard, all alone and nice.

338
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:26,000
Dê zivaro, zivaro.
 
Come turn back, turn back.

339
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:46,000
Maşallah, çi bayekî hênik tê.
 
Mashallah, what a cool breeze comes.

