343
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:07,000
Çençeliya Hec Cemalo.
 
Chencheliya of Hajj Jemalo.

344
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:09,000
Hec Cemalo ha.
 
Hajj Jemalo, huh.

345
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:12,000
Wele mentîqekî pir bilind e.
 
By God, it is a very high region.

346
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:23,000
Maşallah.
 
Mashallah.

347
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:29,000
Wele berî vê hatin me vîdyo gelek malan çêkir, bes min
