348
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:31,000
Maşallah pir kîbar e.
 
Mashallah it is very grand/noble.

349
00:38:31,000 --> 00:38:33,000
Ev ê jêrî, cotî hews, ev Ziyaret e.
 
This one below, the pair of courtyards, this is the Shrine
