350
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:35,000
Ew bîra borcuq e.
 
That is the well of Borjuq.

351
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:37,000
Ziyareta Borjuq.
 
The Borjuq Shrine.

352
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:39,000
Erê, belê, wara tê reben e.
 
Yes, indeed, over there it is poor/ruined.

353
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:41,000
Erê wara reben e.
 
Yes, there it is poor/ruined.

354
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:43,000
Ziyaret e vî derê git tirban e.
 
It is a shrine, this place is all tombs/graves.

355
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:45,000
Cihê hespê e.
 
It is a place for horses.

356
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:47,000
Mezal, yanî.
 
A cemetery, meaning.

357
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:48,000
Mezal, hine şêx in.
 
A cemetery, some are Sheikhs.

358
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:49,000
Bela mirov ne di vir de biçin.
 
It's better if people don't go through here.

359
00:38:49,000 --> 00:38:50,000
Ne ne, emê neçin zate.
 
No no, we won't go anyway.

360
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:51,000
Wara, ser rê bibe.
 
Come, take to the road.

361
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:53,000
Erê were ser rê, were ser rê çêtir e.
 
Yes come to the road, come to the road it is better.

362
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:54,000
Erê.
 
Yes.

363
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:55,000
Maşallah.
 
Mashallah.

364
00:38:55,000 --> 00:39:15,000
Amcî lo, kulek a.
 
Uncle lo, it is a hole/opening.

365
00:39:44,000 --> 00:40:03,000
Were.
 
Come.

366
