370
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:42,000
Çavê we giya maç dikim, Xwedê destê xwe li ser giya bigre.
 
I kiss all your eyes, may God hold His hand over all of you.

371
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:46,000
Înşallah we te'm jê kiribe, dilê giya pê hebe.
 
God willing you enjoyed it, I hope everyone liked it.

372
00:41:46,000 --> 00:41:49,000
Maşallah tebîetek rind bû, menzereyek xweş bû.
 
Mashallah it was a nice nature, it was a beautiful view.

373
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:53,000
Bîr nekin, layk û iştîrak ji me ra pê da nê.
 
