376
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:02,000
Tabe'en emê xatirê xwe ji we bixwazin.
 
Of course we will say goodbye to you.

377
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:07,000
Se'eta giya xweş, çavê giya maç dikim, bay bay.
 
Have a good time everyone, I kiss everyone's eyes, bye bye.

